WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:01.640
A third-rank official

00:01.840 --> 00:02.960
Abandoned so easily

00:03.120 --> 00:05.200
The Chen family really has great resources

00:05.280 --> 00:07.320
No matter how great the Chen family's loss

00:07.400 --> 00:08.520
We would never shelter

00:08.600 --> 00:10.400
A traitor who harms the state and people

00:10.480 --> 00:12.147
We have all the evidence

00:12.280 --> 00:13.480
Clear and undeniable

00:13.560 --> 00:14.040
Absolutely

00:14.120 --> 00:15.880
No room for sophistry

